    "detailed_description": "This is a top-down large map world built with 2D elements.<br />\r\nUsing a turn-based combat system, it is a game that focuses on strategic combat and character development.<br />\r\nIt is based on the Chinese martial arts atmosphere. Because it is independently developed, many of the materials may not achieve the fairy tale atmosphere. Please forgive me.<br />\r\nThe story line is that the protagonist leaves his hometown and goes to the world alone to find exercises and elixirs to become stronger.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. Open world treasure hunt exploration<br />\r\n2. Flexible combination of various Kung Fu schools<br />\r\n3. Equipment system, which can collect herbs and elixirs<br />\r\n4. Multi difficulty challenges",
